= Algebra

== Sums

$
c^a + c^(a+1) + dots + c^b &= (c^(b+1) - c^a)/(c-1), quad c != 1 \
1 + 2 + 3 + dots + n &= (n(n+1))/2 \
1^2 + 2^2 + 3^2 + dots + n^2 &= (n(2n+1)(n+1))/6 \
1^3 + 2^3 + 3^3 + dots + n^3 &= (n^2(n+1)^2)/4 \
1^4 + 2^4 + 3^4 + dots + n^4 &= (n(n+1)(2n+1)(3n^2 + 3n - 1))/30
$

